   "subject": "Re: Bouts for VPA and MPA",
   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Hi Thomas,<div><br></div><div>For Part2 you set mvpathreshold. Part2 provides results with no differentiation between sleep / wake.</div><div><br></div><div>For Part5 you set threshold.lig / threshold.mod / threshold.vig and their respective bout criteria as well. Part5 differentiates between sleep / wake and differentiates between moderate and vigorous physical activity. It sounds like you are interested in using Part5 outputs.</div><div><br></div><div>Cheers, Matt</div></div>"
    ],
    [
